   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"text-align:right\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">שלום<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">יש לי שאלה שאינה בהכרח קשורה ל</span><span dir=\"LTR\">R</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> , אך ידוע לי שיש כאן\r\nאנשים חזקים בסטטיסטיקה שאולי ישמחו לתרום מבינתם.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">השאלה: מהם ההבדלים במשמעות החישוב של מובהקות סטטיסטית בין אם מבצעים\r\nאותו על מדגם לבין מבצעים אותו על כלל האוכלוסיה?</span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"LTR\"><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span>\r\n</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span>Why should I sample instead of\r\nusing the entire population?<span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span>(<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u>שאלה ממשיכה: כיצד מגדירים את כלל האוכלוסיה? (נניח רוצים לבחון תרופה לאלצהיימר , מיהי כלל האוכלוסיה?)<u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">יום טוב<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">קרן</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
