</u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:6pt 0in 10.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\" align=\"right\"><span dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"HE\">קרן</span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><u></u><u></u></font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction:rtl\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"HE\"> </span></p></font></span></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-g...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497026641000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QSuwV_OAgWBsX_P3HTbNd\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-g...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497026641000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QSuwV_OAgWBsX_P3HTbNd\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
